  - m_Id: 4449678119657472
    m_Localized: "To register, you need to enter :\n - a username that other players
      can see\n - an e-mail address\n - a password (at least 8 characters, including
      at least one number), to be written twice\n - Your date of birth"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4450847093153792
    m_Localized: 'To create an account, click on "Register".

      If you already
      have an account, click on "Connect".'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4451182243209216
    m_Localized: "To log in, you must enter :\n - The username you chose when registering
      or your e-mail address\n - The password you filled in when registering"
